  "synthetic": false,
  "negative": false,
  "validity": "valid",
  "shapes": [
    "scmap-colliding-keys",
    "contract-event"
  ],
  "why": "An ScMap may hold U32(1), String(\"1\") and Symbol(\"1\") (or Bool(true), U32(1), I32(1)) as distinct keys, ordered by type and then value. Converting to a native map keyed by string or number collapses them. Readers that convert silently lose entries.",
